      "text_projection": "面试公司：南京某中厂（应该算中厂）\n面试岗位：Java后端开发（实习）\n面试工程：全程一个半小时（三个面试官-技术、人事、某总）",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/685773e20000000023006829.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "1eab8f66730162f28ee3b5ff2b3132b9288b5e47268f513e2291046b9c985711",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/685773e20000000023006829.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "1d50a9a52787b1c9f45e2392f2ffd59b5756cf89b111dbe2b4bc88a8e3fb7b9c",
        "source_projection_item_number": 1
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:685773e20000000023006829:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-5:u2",
      "position": 2,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "（以下并非按照面试顺序提问的，我是按照我的简历顺序复盘的）\n技术拷打：\nJava进程之间是怎么沟通的，同一个进程里面，两个线程要怎么交流？*\nJava数据结构知道吗，讲一讲数组的原理\nArrayList和LinkedList有什么区别？*（问这个的时候博主已经有点晕了，没回答好）\nConcurrentHashMap知道吗\n你系统的学过数据结构的课吗（由于上一个没答好，二次拷打）\nSpring是怎么实现的？*\n微服务会吗*\nMyBatis是怎么实现的？\n讲一讲IOC和AOP\n反射知道吗？\nMySQL事务管理、索引、锁都有了解吗\n知道为什么要用Redis吗\n项目拷打（点评篇）",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/685773e20000000023006829.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "1eab8f66730162f28ee3b5ff2b3132b9288b5e47268f513e2291046b9c985711",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/685773e20000000023006829.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "1d50a9a52787b1c9f45e2392f2ffd59b5756cf89b111dbe2b4bc88a8e3fb7b9c",
        "source_projection_item_number": 2
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:685773e20000000023006829:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-5:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "乐观锁讲一下\n乐观锁怎么用它处理多线程问题的\n你乐观锁是怎么实现的，底层源码看过吗？*\n看过Redis底层源码吗，它是用C++写的，你能看得懂C++吗？*\n项目中为什么用消息队列，不用阻塞队列\n你项目中用消息队列，消费者和消费者之间是怎么联系的？*\nRedis中ZSet的底层看过吗？",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/685773e20000000023006829.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "1eab8f66730162f28ee3b5ff2b3132b9288b5e47268f513e2291046b9c985711",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/685773e20000000023006829.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "1d50a9a52787b1c9f45e2392f2ffd59b5756cf89b111dbe2b4bc88a8e3fb7b9c",
        "source_projection_item_number": 3
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:685773e20000000023006829:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-5:u4",
      "position": 4,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "项目拷打（外卖篇）\n介绍一下你做的项目（面试官会随时打断）\nWebSocket与Http、Https有什么区别？*\n你项目中的多线程是用什么创建的？\n你的第二个项目用什么做的，是只用了web还是有小程序什么？\n前端用的什么，Vue还是什么别的？*\n学过前端吗？\n你这个项目，你从哪里找到的，是不是就是在做CRUD？",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/685773e20000000023006829.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
